<title>USA: CalComp names Robert Watson treasurer.</title>
<headline>CalComp names Robert Watson treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalComp Technology Inc said Tuesday it appointed Robert Watson as vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>Watson, 53, comes to CalComp from Encore Computer Corp, where he had been treasurer since 1990.</p>
<p>In CalComp's newly-created position of treasurer he is responsible for banking, cash/currency management, credit and collections, financing, investor and shareholder relations, mergers and acquisitions, and risk management.</p>
</text>
